{
  "story_id": "house-of-clocks",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 231960,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Wren waited for morning, and then all through breakfast, and then all through the long strange day that followed.",
      "start_ms": 1247,
      "end_ms": 8016
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Great-Aunt Marlow showed her the garden, and taught her the names of six kinds of bees, and made a lunch of buttered toast with jam and honey on the same slice, which turned out to be much better than it sounded.",
      "start_ms": 8016,
      "end_ms": 20723
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "But Wren was only half listening.",
      "start_ms": 20723,
      "end_ms": 22742
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "She was thinking about the music box.",
      "start_ms": 22742,
      "end_ms": 25057
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "That night, when the house was quiet and the clocks had settled into their steady soft rain, Wren crept out of her room and along the hallway to Great-Aunt Marlow's bedroom door.",
      "start_ms": 25057,
      "end_ms": 35745
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The door was open a crack.",
      "start_ms": 35745,
      "end_ms": 37408
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Great-Aunt Marlow was asleep in a huge four-poster bed, snoring in a way that was somehow very dignified.",
      "start_ms": 37408,
      "end_ms": 43702
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Moonlight came in through the tall windows and lay in silver stripes across the floor.",
      "start_ms": 43702,
      "end_ms": 48927
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "The music box was on the dresser.",
      "start_ms": 48927,
      "end_ms": 50946
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "It was made of walnut wood, small and neat, with a tiny brass keyhole.",
      "start_ms": 50946,
      "end_ms": 55221
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Wren tiptoed in.",
      "start_ms": 55221,
      "end_ms": 56231
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "She lifted the lid.",
      "start_ms": 56231,
      "end_ms": 57478
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Inside, on a little velvet cushion, was a single small brass key.",
      "start_ms": 57478,
      "end_ms": 61456
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "She took the key.",
      "start_ms": 61456,
      "end_ms": 62525
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "She lowered the lid.",
      "start_ms": 62525,
      "end_ms": 63772
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She turned to go.",
      "start_ms": 63772,
      "end_ms": 64900
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "The floorboard creaked.",
      "start_ms": 64900,
      "end_ms": 66384
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Wren froze.",
      "start_ms": 66384,
      "end_ms": 67097
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Great-Aunt Marlow shifted in her sleep, murmured something Wren could not catch, and did not wake up.",
      "start_ms": 67097,
      "end_ms": 73213
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Wren slipped out of the room and back down the hall, holding the key so tightly that its little brass teeth pressed into her palm.",
      "start_ms": 73213,
      "end_ms": 80991
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "She stopped in front of the backwards clock, and waited.",
      "start_ms": 80991,
      "end_ms": 84435
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "It felt like hours.",
      "start_ms": 84435,
      "end_ms": 85623
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "It was probably only minutes.",
      "start_ms": 85623,
      "end_ms": 87463
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "The other clocks began to strike midnight.",
      "start_ms": 87463,
      "end_ms": 90076
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "One.",
      "start_ms": 90076,
      "end_ms": 90373
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Two.",
      "start_ms": 90373,
      "end_ms": 90670
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Three.",
      "start_ms": 90670,
      "end_ms": 91145
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Wren's hands were shaking.",
      "start_ms": 91145,
      "end_ms": 92807
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Four.",
      "start_ms": 92807,
      "end_ms": 93164
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Five.",
      "start_ms": 93164,
      "end_ms": 93520
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Six.",
      "start_ms": 93520,
      "end_ms": 93876
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "She fitted the key into the small hole in the front of the backwards clock.",
      "start_ms": 93876,
      "end_ms": 98389
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "It slid in perfectly.",
      "start_ms": 98389,
      "end_ms": 99755
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Seven.",
      "start_ms": 99755,
      "end_ms": 100170
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Eight.",
      "start_ms": 100170,
      "end_ms": 100586
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Nine.",
      "start_ms": 100586,
      "end_ms": 101002
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "She could feel it now — the presence behind her, arriving.",
      "start_ms": 101002,
      "end_ms": 104505
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "But she did not turn.",
      "start_ms": 104505,
      "end_ms": 105871
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Ten.",
      "start_ms": 105871,
      "end_ms": 106167
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Eleven.",
      "start_ms": 106167,
      "end_ms": 106642
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Twelve.",
      "start_ms": 106642,
      "end_ms": 107177
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "The pause.",
      "start_ms": 107177,
      "end_ms": 107889
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "The backwards clock struck.",
      "start_ms": 107889,
      "end_ms": 109552
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Once.",
      "start_ms": 109552,
      "end_ms": 109908
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Softly.",
      "start_ms": 109908,
      "end_ms": 110383
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Thirteen.",
      "start_ms": 110383,
      "end_ms": 111036
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Wren turned the key.",
      "start_ms": 111036,
      "end_ms": 112224
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "For a moment, nothing happened.",
      "start_ms": 112224,
      "end_ms": 114158
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Then, very slowly, the second hand of the backwards clock began to move the other way.",
      "start_ms": 114158,
      "end_ms": 119417
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Forward.",
      "start_ms": 119417,
      "end_ms": 120021
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "The air in the hallway went warm.",
      "start_ms": 120021,
      "end_ms": 122137
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Wren turned around.",
      "start_ms": 122137,
      "end_ms": 123406
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "There was a boy standing behind her.",
      "start_ms": 123406,
      "end_ms": 125642
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "He was about eight, with untidy hair and a serious face.",
      "start_ms": 125642,
      "end_ms": 129087
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "He was almost solid, but not quite — she could see the wallpaper faintly through his shoulder.",
      "start_ms": 129087,
      "end_ms": 134829
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "He was staring at his hands as if he had never seen them before.",
      "start_ms": 134829,
      "end_ms": 138819
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "\"I remember,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 138819,
      "end_ms": 140209
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "His voice was still quiet, but no longer far away.",
      "start_ms": 140209,
      "end_ms": 143291
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "\"My name is Thomas.\"",
      "start_ms": 143291,
      "end_ms": 144621
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "\"Hello, Thomas,\" said Wren.",
      "start_ms": 144621,
      "end_ms": 146313
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "\"I'm Wren.\"",
      "start_ms": 146313,
      "end_ms": 147099
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Thomas smiled, and then his smile faded a little.",
      "start_ms": 147099,
      "end_ms": 150182
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "\"I can't go back to my time,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 150182,
      "end_ms": 152539
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "\"And I can't go forward, either.",
      "start_ms": 152539,
      "end_ms": 154534
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I'm free of the clock, but I have nowhere to be.\"",
      "start_ms": 154534,
      "end_ms": 157616
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Wren thought about this.",
      "start_ms": 157616,
      "end_ms": 159188
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "\"You could be here,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 159188,
      "end_ms": 161061
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "\"With us.",
      "start_ms": 161061,
      "end_ms": 161666
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I mean — with me.",
      "start_ms": 161666,
      "end_ms": 162754
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "When I come back next summer, and the summer after that.\"",
      "start_ms": 162754,
      "end_ms": 166320
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Thomas looked up at her.",
      "start_ms": 166320,
      "end_ms": 167891
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "\"Would you really?\"",
      "start_ms": 167891,
      "end_ms": 169161
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "\"Every summer,\" said Wren.",
      "start_ms": 169161,
      "end_ms": 170792
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "\"I promise.\"",
      "start_ms": 170792,
      "end_ms": 171639
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Somewhere in the house, a clock struck a small polite chime, as if it had been listening and approved.",
      "start_ms": 171639,
      "end_ms": 177925
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "In the morning, Wren came downstairs to find Great-Aunt Marlow already at the kitchen table, drinking tea and looking at the hallway with a small pleased expression on her face.",
      "start_ms": 177925,
      "end_ms": 188744
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "\"The backwards clock isn't backwards anymore,\" said Wren, cautiously.",
      "start_ms": 188744,
      "end_ms": 193035
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "\"No,\" said Great-Aunt Marlow.",
      "start_ms": 193035,
      "end_ms": 194848
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "\"It isn't.\"",
      "start_ms": 194848,
      "end_ms": 195634
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "There was a long, comfortable silence.",
      "start_ms": 195634,
      "end_ms": 198052
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "\"You knew,\" said Wren.",
      "start_ms": 198052,
      "end_ms": 199503
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Great-Aunt Marlow set down her cup.",
      "start_ms": 199503,
      "end_ms": 201739
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "\"When I was your age,\" she said, \"I stayed in this house for a summer, too.",
      "start_ms": 201739,
      "end_ms": 206333
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "And a boy who lived in a clock became my very good friend.",
      "start_ms": 206333,
      "end_ms": 209899
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "But then I grew up, and I got busy, and I forgot to come back.",
      "start_ms": 209899,
      "end_ms": 213706
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "And a person who is forgotten goes back into the clock, my dear.",
      "start_ms": 213706,
      "end_ms": 217635
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "That is how it works.\"",
      "start_ms": 217635,
      "end_ms": 219086
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "She looked at Wren over the top of her glasses.",
      "start_ms": 219086,
      "end_ms": 222047
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "\"Do not forget him.\"",
      "start_ms": 222047,
      "end_ms": 223377
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "\"I won't,\" said Wren.",
      "start_ms": 223377,
      "end_ms": 224767
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "And somewhere down the hall, a small clock ticked forward, softly, into a future it had waited a very long time to see.",
      "start_ms": 224767,
      "end_ms": 231960
    }
  ]
}